<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK FOREX TRADE TURNOVER FALLS IN AUGUST - NBS.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK FOREX TRADE TURNOVER FALLS IN AUGUST - NBS.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total foreign exchange</p>
<p>trading in Slovakia fell to $4.99 billion in August from $6.15</p>
<p>billion in July, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX TRADING	AUGUST     JULY	  JUNE</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>  overall			4,993	6,150	 3,491</p>
<p>  USD trading		  3,320	3,926	 1,816</p>
<p>  DM trading		   1,516	2,032	 1,486</p>
<p>  other currencies	     158	  193	   189</p>
<p>TRADING IN USD</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 83	   57	   100</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	    2,846	3,664	 1,655</p>
<p>  at foreign banks	     391	  205	    61</p>
<p>  total			  3,320	3,926	 3,491</p>
<p>TRADING IN DM</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 95	   21	   127</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	    1,326	1,928	 1,329</p>
<p>  foreign banks		   95	   83	    31</p>
<p>  total			  1,516	2,031	 1,486</p>
<p>TRADING IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks		113	  158	   162</p>
<p>  foreign banks		   45	   35	    27</p>
<p>  total			    158	  193	   189</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF USD TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 20	    5	    23</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks		879	1,163	   829</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  136	   76	    24</p>
<p>  total			  1,035	1,244	   876</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF DM TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 24	    4	    26</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks		730	  962	   873</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  115	   73	    58</p>
<p>  total			    869	1,039	   957</p>
<p>TOTAL  NUMBER OF TADES IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
